    "Next time, %@ opens after %@, and only %@: the passcode cannot read the saved key. If %@ is locked out after failed attempts, turned off, or re-enrolled, unlock with the key or the passphrase instead. The key stays in this device's Keychain and is not included in backups." : {
      "comment" : "Unlock sheet footer; the first value is the vault name, the others the biometry (Face ID, Touch ID)",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La próxima vez, %1$@ se abrirá tras %2$@, y solo con %2$@: el código no puede leer la clave guardada. Si %2$@ se bloquea tras intentos fallidos, se desactiva o se vuelve a configurar, desbloquea con la clave o la frase de contraseña. La clave se queda en el Llavero de este dispositivo y no se incluye en las copias de seguridad."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next time, %@ opens after your device passcode. The key stays in this device's Keychain and is not included in backups." : {
