    "Removes autosaves older than %@. Keeps every checkpoint (saved and imported versions), the newest save of each editing session, the note's newest version and everything from the last %@." : {
      "comment" : "Thinning rule explanation; both values are the same age, “30 days”, “1 year”…",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elimina los guardados automáticos de más de %1$@. Conserva todos los puntos de control (versiones guardadas e importadas), el guardado más reciente de cada sesión de edición, la versión más reciente de la nota y todo lo de los últimos %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Removes every autosave, however recent, except the newest save of each editing session. Keeps every checkpoint (saved and imported versions) and the note's newest version." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
