    "“%@” can't be found any more. It may have been moved or deleted, or access to it expired. Choose its folder again." : {
      "comment" : "%@ is a vault's name",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ya no se encuentra “%@”. Puede que se haya movido o eliminado, o que su acceso haya caducado. Vuelve a elegir su carpeta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is ready. Save this secret key now: anyone with it can read the vault, and without it (or a passphrase-wrapped copy) the vault cannot be opened again." : {
      "comment" : "%@ is the new vault's name",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” está lista. Guarda esta clave secreta ahora: cualquiera que la tenga puede leer la bóveda, y sin ella (o sin una copia protegida con frase de contraseña) la bóveda no se podrá volver a abrir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Untitled”" : {
      "comment" : "Settings ▸ New Notes footer: how a note with no title is shown, in quotes",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
